@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<https://example.org/qa#assessment-561c7f861d1656c4> a dqv:QualityMetadata ;
    dqv:hasQualityMeasurement <https://example.org/qa#measurement-078124ea9f7b37fd>,
        <https://example.org/qa#measurement-5a6f40bd921ab18b>,
        <https://example.org/qa#measurement-5b81c9e52a512e1c>,
        <https://example.org/qa#measurement-5ea31fe6dac2cdb3>,
